  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0\n\n- BREAKING: Dropped .NET Standard 2.0 support (targets: net10.0, net9.0, net8.0)\n- Centralized all conditional compilation into a single Polyfills.cs helper\n- Removed scattered #if NET6_0_OR_GREATER / NETSTANDARD2_0 directives across 6+ files\n- Removed Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces and Microsoft.Bcl.HashCode dependencies\n- SimpleMultiMap becomes Obsolete\n\nSee full Release Notes history: https://github.com/TigoS/MultiMap/blob/master/Docs/ReleaseNotes.md",
